<title>EGYPT: Egypt's EAB Q1 net up 20 pct.</title>
<headline>Egypt's EAB Q1 net up 20 pct.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>First quarter 1997.</p>
<p>(All figures are in millions of Egyptian pounds, comparative figures are as reported a year ago )</p>
<p>				  Jan97-March97    Jan96-March96</p>
<p> Interest received		50.3		 49.762</p>
<p> Interest paid		    51.6		 52.288</p>
<p> Revenue from services etc.   22.8		 16.855</p>
<p> Investment revenue	     20.9		 19.783</p>
<p> Expenses			   16.4		 15.009</p>
<p> Provisions			  3.1		 ------</p>
<p> Net profits			22.9		 19.104</p>
<p>Full name is Egyptian American Bank.</p>
<p>$1 =3.395 pounds</p>
<p>-- Cairo newsroom +20 2 578 3290/1</p>
</text>
